</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[ONS precedes permission: an invalid held request cannot reset later automatically.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_Cmd_Reset)ONS(ProductionResetONS)[XIC(Production_Flt_IndexTimeout) ,XIC(Production_Flt_IndexConfirmTimeout) ,XIC(Production_Flt_StartupRecoveryRequired) ,XIC(Production_Flt_TrackingMismatch) ,XIC(Production_Flt_InvalidState) ,XIC(Production_Flt_IndexInterlock) ,XIC(Production_Flt_InvalidConfiguration) ]XIC(Sys_Sts_ResetAllowed)[OTU(Production_Flt_IndexTimeout) ,OTU(Production_Flt_IndexConfirmTimeout) ,OTU(Production_Flt_StartupRecoveryRequired) ,OTU(Production_Flt_TrackingMismatch) ,OTU(Production_Flt_InvalidState) ,OTU(Production_Flt_IndexInterlock) ,OTU(Production_Flt_InvalidConfiguration) ,OTE(Production_Sts_ResetAccepted) ];]]>
</Text>
